          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vinyl tapes are versatile safety solutions used to mark barriers, define pathways, and draw attention to potential hazards. Designed for durability and visibility, they provide a reliable way to improve organization and safety across industrial, commercial, and facility environments.</p><p>Vinyl tapes featuring <strong>rubber-based adhesives</strong> adhere well to a wide range of substrates, including pipes, wiring, concrete, asphalt, and other challenging surfaces, ensuring dependable performance in both indoor and outdoor applications.</p>",
