          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Social distancing decals and labels allow you to provide <a href=\"https://press-sensitive-tapes-labels.nadco-inc.com/category/directional-flow-tapes\" target=\"_blank\">directions</a> , pathways, and 6 ft. placement in queues, so customers have a clear means of avoiding close contact and adhering to distancing requirements. Bright and bold colors such as red, orange, and yellow provide a visible cue that enhances customer awareness, while hazard stripes help people avoid standing too close to one another.</p>",
