    "image_with_text_mPyFXY": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_aChRLN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Vinyl Labels for Durable Identification and Safety",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_knpMd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When labels are exposed to outdoor conditions or harsh environments, material selection is critical. Vinyl labels are a proven solution when durability, flexibility, and long-term performance are required.</p><p>Designed to withstand demanding conditions, vinyl labels offer excellent resistance to moisture, abrasion, UV exposure, temperature fluctuations, oils, and chemicals. Their versatility and conformability allow them to adhere to a wide range of surfaces, making them suitable for both indoor and outdoor applications. At NADCO, we produce custom weatherproof vinyl labels engineered to perform reliably in challenging environments.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_aChRLN",
        "text_knpMd4"
