    "image_with_text_aFTmCH": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_zQdEXw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Common Applications Of Vinyl Labels",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_c4JPKD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Thanks to their durability and versatility, vinyl labels are used in a wide range of industrial, commercial, and safety-focused applications, including:</p><ul><li>Safety and compliance signage</li><li>Industrial chemical and laboratory labels</li><li>Barrel, drum, and container labeling</li><li>Equipment, asset, and inventory identification</li><li>Barcode and tracking labels</li><li>Marine and waterproof applications</li><li>Outdoor equipment and worksite labeling</li><li>Fire exit, construction site, and operational signage</li><li>Refrigerator and freezer labels</li><li>Posters, banners, and instructional graphics</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_zQdEXw",
